## Glassmorphism elements

Implement:

- Floating frosted-glass navigation.
- Translucent service cards.
- Glass-style buttons.
- Frosted-glass mega menus.
- Semi-transparent dark panels.
- Subtle backdrop blur.
- Fine metallic-gold borders.
- Soft ambient reflections.
- Layered translucent surfaces.
- Elegant light refraction effects.
- Premium floating interface elements.
